and against the PR diff at its recorded head SHA and publish a real GitHub review via `gh pr review`. Map VERDICT: APPROVE to an approving review and VERDICT: REVISE to a request-changes review; every finding must cite path:line, and fail closed when output has no valid verdict. Add tests in tests/test_factory.py proving: (1) APPROVE submits exactly one approving review, (2) REVISE submits exactly one changes-requested review containing the cited findings, (3) malformed output submits no approval, and (4) each action is tied to the discovered head SHA. Verification: run `python -m unittest` and confirm it passes.","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikeroySoft/factory/issues/comments/5622896566/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]